/*
 * UnionExpander — expands the vtable a union dispatches through into YIL constants.
 *
 * A union value answers to the methods every one of its members declares
 * identically, whichever member it holds. The table naming those
 * implementations is synthesized per member, so that a call selects a slot and
 * the member held decides the implementation.
 *
 * Nothing is emitted for a union declaring a base: the slot then holds the
 * member's own class vtable, which the class expander already emitted.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::union_
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/union_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-21
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
